    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stable in-place compaction</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/move-zeroes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 283</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Move Zeroes</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A write pointer marks where the next non-zero goes; a read pointer scans. Swap each non-zero into the write slot and the zeros roll to the back on their own. O(n) time, O(1) space, at most one swap per non-zero.</p>\n"
